{"id":"445041","name":"虾仁香芹豆腐羹","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/445041/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"300克"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"100克"},{"name":"香芹","amount":"2棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：豆腐。","img":"images/445041/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾仁（已清洗）。","img":"images/445041/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香芹。","img":"images/445041/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水淀粉。","img":"images/445041/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将香芹摘去叶子去根洗净、捞出。","img":"images/445041/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用剪刀剪碎，待用。","img":"images/445041/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将豆腐撕开包装倒扣在盘中，用刀划开，待用。","img":"images/445041/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入虾仁，加点料酒翻炒一下。","img":"images/445041/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着，合入豆腐。","img":"images/445041/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加一些清水煮开。","img":"images/445041/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"然后，合入香芹，加点盐、鸡精调味翻动一下。","img":"images/445041/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后，倒入水淀粉勾芡，即成。","img":"images/445041/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}